label good_ending:
    play sound "audio/bgs/office_car_bg.mp3"
    scene bg office_blurred with fade

    show elowyn smile at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100

    "It had been a week since Elowyn declared the culprit. The town was buzzing, still not fully recovered from the incident."

    "The news of Elliot’s plan reached everyone’s ears, and many had mixed reactions."

    "Elliot had been swiftly arrested this time."

    "Valentine promised to protect her people, ensuring something like this would never happen again."

    "Elowyn, on the other hand, had been thoroughly congratulated. It was probably the first time she’d seen the mayor genuinely smile."

    "The rest of the townsfolk were similarly thankful."

    "Crumblepuff sent her home with so many pastries that Elowyn was sure she’d be eating them for months."

    "Paige gifted her a box full of her favorite books, which was more shocking than Elliot being the culprit."

    show elowyn thinking at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "Jasper offered to give her a kitten, but Elowyn had never been a cat person. She somewhat appreciated the thought, though."

    show elowyn smile at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "Her first real case–cases, really–and Elowyn knocked it out of the park! Her Boss had even remembered her name when she returned."

    show elowyn analyzing at sprite_size:
        xalign 0.5
        yalign 1.0
        yoffset 100
    "One thing was for sure…she wouldn’t be going back to Londerdawn anytime soon!"

    "Fin."


return